yle='box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: source-sans-pro, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);'>•\tNombre de collisions impliquant des cyclistes (inclus dans le nombre total de collisions)</p></div><div><br /></div><div><strong>Fréquence des mises à jour</strong><span style='font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;'>: Annuelle </span><br /><br /><strong>Courriel de l'auteur</strong><span style='font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;'>: </span><a href='mailto:tetsuro.ide@ottawa.ca' style='color: rgb(0, 121, 193); text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;'>Transportation Data Collection &amp; Analytics</a><br /></div>"
